{
  "id": "course-schedule",
  "order": 47,
  "title": "Course Schedule",
  "difficulty": "Medium",
  "pattern": "Topological sort",
  "statement": "There are `numCourses` courses labelled `0` to `numCourses - 1`. `prerequisites[i] = [a, b]` means you must take `b` before `a`. Return `true` if you can finish every course.",
  "constraints": [
    "1 <= numCourses <= 2000",
    "0 <= prerequisites.length <= 5000",
    "All pairs are distinct"
  ],
  "function": {
    "name": "canFinish",
    "params": [
      {
        "name": "numCourses",
        "type": "int"
      },
      {
        "name": "prerequisites",
        "type": "int[][]"
      }
    ],
    "returns": "bool"
  },
  "complexity": {
    "time": "O(V + E)",
    "space": "O(V + E)"
  },
  "hints": [
    "Model courses as a directed graph. What structure makes finishing impossible?",
    "You can finish exactly when the graph has no cycle.",
    "Kahn's algorithm: repeatedly take courses with in-degree 0; if you take all of them there is no cycle. DFS with three colours also works."
  ],
  "tests": [
    {
      "args": [
        2,
        [
          [
            1,
            0
          ]
        ]
      ],
      "expected": true,
      "hidden": false,
      "explanation": "Take 0, then 1."
    },
    {
      "args": [
        2,
        [
          [
            1,
            0
          ],
          [
            0,
            1
          ]
        ]
      ],
      "expected": false,
      "hidden": false,
      "explanation": "A cycle."
    },
    {
      "args": [
        1,
        []
      ],
      "expected": true,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        3,
        [
          [
            0,
            1
          ],
          [
            1,
            2
          ],
          [
            2,
            0
          ]
        ]
      ],
      "expected": false,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        4,
        [
          [
            1,
            0
          ],
          [
            2,
            1
          ],
          [
            3,
            2
          ]
        ]
      ],
      "expected": true,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        3,
        [
          [
            1,
            0
          ],
          [
            2,
            0
          ]
        ]
      ],
      "expected": true,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        6,
        [
          [
            1,
            0
          ],
          [
            4,
            2
          ]
        ]
      ],
      "expected": true,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        3,
        [
          [
            1,
            2
          ],
          [
            2,
            0
          ]
        ]
      ],
      "expected": true,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        5,
        [
          [
            1,
            3
          ],
          [
            1,
            4
          ],
          [
            2,
            3
          ],
          [
            3,
            1
          ]
        ]
      ],
      "expected": false,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        7,
        [
          [
            1,
            4
          ]
        ]
      ],
      "expected": true,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        7,
        [
          [
            0,
            4
          ],
          [
            2,
            5
          ],
          [
            3,
            2
          ],
          [
            4,
            1
          ],
          [
            5,
            6
          ],
          [
            6,
            1
          ]
        ]
      ],
      "expected": true,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        5,
        []
      ],
      "expected": true,
      "hidden": true
    }
  ]
}
